02:39:16.290 --> 02:39:16.760
- It was beautiful.

02:39:16.760 --> 02:39:17.301
- Really was.

02:39:17.301 --> 02:39:19.220
- Finally the sun was out.

02:39:19.220 --> 02:39:21.470
- What a view today,
as several World War II

02:39:21.470 --> 02:39:23.720
